 ('MC03','Fully genuine current checker009 peer002/root4a receipt; change only its selectedSHA to old0081b4, restore.','Root selects only genuine checker009 Source peer002'),
 ('MC04','Healthy selected C20 and RootP16; mutate only C scope with coherent fixture input pin so all previous read gates pass; restore.','Root config nominal literal'),
 ('MC05','Healthy post-INIT externally authenticated Roottrust8 and INIT8; change only INIT PID to bool with coherent fixture input pin; restore.','actual Root PID/nonce domains'),
 ('MC06','Healthy metadata Source11 plus six assignments and all ASTs; change one sourcebody, restore.','complete M3 six-assignment source reversal'),
 ('MC07','Healthy authentic Bound9 complete nominals; change only recordtype with coherent fixture input pin, restore.','authentic metadata bound Source peer.record_type literal'),
