handoff='''# Constructor Source handoff\n\nThis data-only constructor source assembles the utility2/composer1 literal assignments only after genuine Root selection of closed Source inputs and post-INIT externally authenticated Root trust. It pins accepted U007, checker009/Root peer4a, M3final005, GG6final009/static20, Rootwriter2ca historical32bd plus genuine Owner supplementc451 and corrected Binder002. Source selection template SHA fields are None. No actual selection or models, Source peer, READY, Root GO, INIT, phase capture, runtime or tests were generated.\n\nThe existing U/composer131072 and checker262144 source caps remain. Exact final byte sizes for all five models/bound sources plus the compact projection are checked before the first write. Assignment byte reversal and all function/class ASTs are exact. Partial publication is consumed; no batch atomicity or OS/Job/deadline/producer attestation is claimed.\n\nTwo own metadata author attempts failed; partial Source table is preserved and completed by distinct finalizer002. These were not helper/runtime/test failures. Eighteen causal Source control plans and calculated mandatory-only lower byte budget are preparation, not executable tests or actual fit. Root must obtain different full constructor Source review before physically running the constructor, then independently verify the full actual bound pool and emit its genuine peer20 before READY/GO/capture.\n'''
